        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Placeholder. Requires a per-ActivitySource span-duration histogram meter (e.g. honua_span_duration_ms{source=\"Honua.Server.Export\"}) to be added; the OTel SDK does not export span durations as Prometheus histograms. See #1144.",
      "fieldConfig": {
